    "Homebrew settings are read from brew.env files. Shell profiles and exported variables are ignored. Put user settings in ~/.homebrew/brew.env, then relaunch BrewUI." : {
      "comment" : "Configuration tab: where Homebrew reads its settings from",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los ajustes de Homebrew se leen de los archivos brew.env. Se ignoran los perfiles de shell y las variables exportadas. Pon tus ajustes de usuario en ~/.homebrew/brew.env y vuelve a abrir BrewUI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 设置从 brew.env 文件读取，不读取 Shell 配置文件或导出的环境变量。请将用户设置写入 ~/.homebrew/brew.env，然后重新打开 BrewUI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 設定從 brew.env 檔案讀取，不讀取 Shell 設定檔或匯出的環境變數。請將使用者設定寫入 ~/.homebrew/brew.env，然後重新開啟 BrewUI。"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inställningar för Homebrew läses från filerna brew.env. Skalprofiler och exporterade variabler ignoreras. Lägg användarinställningar i ~/.homebrew/brew.env och starta sedan om BrewUI."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 설정은 brew.env 파일에서 읽습니다. 셸 프로파일과 내보낸 변수는 무시됩니다. 사용자 설정을 ~/.homebrew/brew.env에 넣은 다음 BrewUI를 다시 실행하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
